  "message": "Coach here. Bulk block is on. I rebuilt your Shoulders · All day off today's session.\n- Overhead press is the anchor: hit 115×8, then move to 120.\n- Front raises are out. Your pressing already hammers front delts, so those sets go to side delts.\n- Lateral raises move to the end as FST-7: 7 sets, 30-35s rest, chase the pump. Side delts build the width.\n- Log working sets only, not warm-ups, so your numbers stay honest.",
